📜 Code of Conduct 

We are committed to providing a friendly, safe, and inclusive environment for everyone involved in the PWC (Prigid World Cloud) project.

By participating in this project, you agree to follow this Code of Conduct.

---

💬 Our Standards

- Be respectful and welcoming
- Avoid personal attacks and harassment
- Use inclusive and appropriate language
- Respect differing viewpoints and experiences
- Accept constructive criticism with grace

---
 🚫 Unacceptable Behavior

- Discrimination or hateful speech
- Threats of violence or intimidation
- Sexually explicit or unwelcome conduct
- Sustained disruption of conversations
- Trolling or insulting others

---

 🙋 Reporting Issues

If you see or experience behavior that violates this Code of Conduct:

📩 Please email: **pwc@prigid.org** (or use a private GitHub issue if enabled)

All reports will be handled with discretion and confidentiality.

---

 🤝 Enforcement

Project maintainers reserve the right to:
- Remove comments or PRs
- Ban contributors violating the code
- Escalate to GitHub if necessary

---

Thank you for helping make PWC a welcoming and inclusive space for everyone. 💙
